or…"],["a37565ff_38338ba0",41,-11,1,"This method is never called in `content`, so it should not be here. To quote [content API guidelines](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:content/public/README.md): ``` Methods…"],["cd8d4325_d19780e7",42,-11,1,"Why do we now need to copy the registry? That sounds counter-intuitive to me. I'd assume it's moved around if needed, not copied."],["ee0ee601_c066f8ec",36,-11,1,"Having non-pure interfaces with some partial implementation is against the [content API guidelines](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:content/public/README.md): ```…"],["ef8871fa_895cb3f4",43,-5,1,"Could we make this bug visible to people outside Google (can't view it with my chromium.org account)"],["92147a91_95039b5d",40,-4,0,"Perhaps this friend is not needed anymore?"],["aaf9903f_9e92b052",44,-4,1,"This method is not used outside of content (rightfully so), so declare it in `WebUIImpl` right away."],["f2b625d3_b6f2935f",45,-4,0,"Hmm I wonder why we manually delete these instead of changing the declaration order to destroy things in the right order."],["7140b52b_7d9077f7",46,-3,1,"This should be trusted - WebUIBrowserUI runs `chrome://webui-browser`."],["c0a29d8d_d0b0440f",47,-3,1,"I don't seem to find where this header is used."]],0,238],[7243415,20440,251,2,1.263,[[39,0.707,3,179],[38,0.228,20,56],[6,0.066,57,16]],[],0,239],[7306191,20449,125,2.344,1.853,[[32,57]],[["0e1f0ac4_3e0d0aa6",30,-4,1,"nit. I think this makes it harder to read. Curious what your thoughts are about readability"],["1884c243_ffb0e0b7",30,-4,0,"There are several places where we'd want to change to `RETURN_IF_ERROR(validations::IsContentType(tab_mojom_id));`. Is that a follow up CL?"],["3cb9f04f_e4004180",30,-4,0,"TIL `RETURN_IF_ERROR` and `ASSIGN_OR_RETURN`. Looks useful."],["53ea031a_2ff2486e",30,-4,0,"Can we introduce a validation framework one level above the service implementation? Maybe a centralized place whenever a NodeId is forwarded over rather than having to check every time the api is…"],["843af21f_1035b101",30,-4,1,"It is a bit weird that `GetNativeId()` is under `validation` namespace. I think the `NodeId` -> `NativeId` conversion deserves a helper function (I almost made one myself), but I won't search under…"],["d31128cd_77d0386c",48,-1,0,"Should this be explicit for tab ids? GetNativeTabId?"]],0,240],[7308942,20449,111,2.344,1.853,[[32,58]],[],0,241]]}